ngHomeObservation\">E5_ReactionDuringHomeObservation</a> = Yes (qualifier value) (SNOMED CT#373066001)</span><br/>Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-YesNoVS.html\">Yes / No Value Set</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck01.png)\" id=\"item.QualityMonitoring\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> QualityMonitoring</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">(Quality) monitoring</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck000.png)\" id=\"item.F1_CommentsRegistration\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-string.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"string\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">QualityMonitoring / </span>F1_CommentsRegistration</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Please note any comments or concerns regarding the registration of this patient, the sharing of data from the hospital, the communication by and contact with the hospital, the availability of materials, or other aspects of the transmural collaboration around home hospitalization oncology. Thank you.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Definition: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#DiagnosticReport.conclusion\">DiagnosticReport.conclusion</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.A1_MedicationStorage\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for A1_MedicationStorage </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#710977001 (\"Safe storage and management of medication\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#424363005 (\"Improper storage of medication\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.C11_Decision\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for C11_Decision </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">administration</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">no administration</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">other</li></ul><h2>Contained Resources</h2><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Patient #patient-placeholder</b></p><a name=\"homehosp-q-onco-definitions/patient-placeholder\"> </a><a name=\"hchomehosp-q-onco-definitions/patient-placeholder\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core/2.1.2/StructureDefinition-be-patient.html\">BePatient</a></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Tag: <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-ObservationValue.html\">subsetted (Details: ObservationValue code SUBSETTED = 'subsetted')</a></p></div><p style=\"border: 1px #661aff solid; background-color: #e6e6ff; padding: 10px;\">Patient Unknown  (no stated gender), DoB Unknown ( http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0203#UNKNOWN)</p><hr/></div>"
  ] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.contained [
     a fhir:Patient ;
     fhir:index -1 ;
     fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "patient-placeholder" ] ;
     fhir:Resource.meta [
       fhir:Meta.profile [
         fhir:value "https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core/StructureDefinition/be-patient" ;
         fhir:index -1 ;
         fhir:link <https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/core/StructureDefinition/be-patient>
       ] ;
       fhir:Meta.tag [
         fhir:index -1 ;
         fhir:Coding.system [ fhir:value "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ObservationValue" ] ;
         fhir:Coding.code [ fhir:value "SUBSETTED" ] ;
         fhir:Coding.display [ fhir:value "subsetted" ]
       ]
     ] ;
     fhir:Patient.identifier [
       fhir:index -1 ;
       fhir:Identifier.system [ fhir:value "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0203" ] ;
       fhir:Identifier.value [ fhir:value "UNKNOWN" ]
     ] ;
     fhir:Patient.name [
       fhir:index -1 ;
       fhir:HumanName.family [ fhir:value "Unknown" ] ;
       fhir:HumanName.given [
         fhir:value "Patient" ;
         fhir:index -1
       ]
     ]
  ] ;
  fhir:Questionnaire.url [ fhir:value "http://hl7belgium.org/fhir/patient-monitoring/Questionnaire/homehosp-q-onco-definitions"] ;
  fhir:Questionnaire.identifier [
     fhir:index -1 ;
     fhir:Identifier.system [ fhir:value "urn:ietf:rfc:3986" ] ;
     fhir:Identifier.value [ fhir:value "urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.4.642.40.54.35.8" ]
